WEBVTT

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:06.940
You did a great job.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.570
Thank you.

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:12.320
Keep it up.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:13.450
Roger that.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.040
Ms. Machiko?

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.250
Hold on.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.130
I'm trying to think of the right words to say.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.250
Huh?

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.920
Your grades aside,

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:31.260
you still haven't submitted your post-graduation plans to me.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.050
Oh...

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:35.050
Don't tell me you still haven't decided?

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.800
Actually, I...

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.560
It's your future.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.310
It's about time you decided what you're going to do.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.560
I know that.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:45.640
In that case...

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.020
Bring it to me tomorrow!

